"""Runtime enforcement for skill tool constraints.

Provides the single collaborator used by ``SkillExecutor`` for
``tool_constraints``. It owns confirmation gating for LLM-dispatched tools and
the additional run/pause/resume lifecycle required by ordered-block
``execute_tool`` steps. ``ToolConfirmationGate`` is an internal helper of this
module — callers should go through :class:`ToolConstraintsExecutor`.
"""

